# Standard Operating Procedure (SOP)

## Document Information
- **Document Title:** Recon Mail Draft Utility - Standard Operating Procedure
- **Version:** 1.0
- **Date:** November 2024
- **Owner:** Finance Operations Team
- **Purpose:** To provide standardized procedures for automated reconciliation email drafting

---

## 1. Overview

### 1.1 Purpose
The Recon Mail Draft Utility automates the process of:
- Capturing screenshots from reconciliation Excel files
- Analyzing variance thresholds
- Drafting formatted emails in Outlook with embedded screenshots
- Maintaining audit logs for compliance

### 1.2 Scope
This SOP applies to:
- Finance Operations team members processing reconciliation reports
- Automated batch processing of multiple reconciliation files
- Manual processing of individual reconciliation files

### 1.3 Benefits
- **Time Savings:** Reduces manual email drafting from 15 minutes to 30 seconds per file
- **Consistency:** Ensures standardized email format and content
- **Accuracy:** Eliminates manual copy-paste errors
- **Audit Trail:** Complete logging of all operations
- **Scalability:** Processes multiple files automatically

