### Algorithm 4: Email Drafting Engine

```
FUNCTION draft_email()
    INPUT:
        - screenshot_paths: List of screenshot info
        - config: Dictionary (email configuration)
        - email_config: Dictionary (recipient configuration)
    
    OUTPUT:
        - success: Boolean
    
    BEGIN
        1. VALIDATE:
            IF screenshot_paths is EMPTY THEN
                LOG warning
                RETURN FALSE
        
        2. Initialize COM
           pythoncom.CoInitialize()
        
        3. TRY:
            a. outlook ← CREATE Outlook.Application (COM object)
            b. mail ← outlook.CreateItem(0)  // 0 = Mail item
        CATCH Exception:
            TRY alternative COM initialization
        
        4. SET SENDER:
            a. sender_email ← email_config['sender_email']
            b. IF sender_email is NOT empty THEN
                i. FOR EACH account IN outlook.Session.Accounts DO
                    IF account.SmtpAddress == sender_email THEN
                        mail.SendUsingAccount ← account
                        BREAK
                
                ii. IF no matching account found THEN
                    mail.SentOnBehalfOfName ← sender_email
        
        5. SET RECIPIENTS:
            a. mail.To ← JOIN email_config['to_recipients'] WITH '; '
            b. mail.CC ← JOIN email_config['cc_recipients'] WITH '; '
        
        6. BUILD SUBJECT:
            a. subject ← config['default_subject']
            b. timestamp ← GET current datetime in configured timezone
            c. subject ← REPLACE '{timestamp}' IN subject WITH timestamp
            d. mail.Subject ← subject
        
        7. BUILD HTML BODY:
            a. html_body ← START HTML document
            
            b. email_body_text ← config['email_body']
            c. email_body_text ← REPLACE '{timestamp}' WITH timestamp
            d. email_body_text ← REPLACE newlines WITH '<br>'
            e. APPEND email_body_text TO html_body
            
            f. embed_count ← 0
            g. FOR EACH screenshot IN screenshot_paths DO
                IF screenshot['embed'] == TRUE THEN
                    i. cid ← "image_" + embed_count
                    ii. APPEND '<img src="cid:' + cid + '">' TO html_body
                    iii. attachment ← mail.Attachments.Add(screenshot['path'])
                    iv. SET attachment.PropertyAccessor to embed with cid
                    v. embed_count ← embed_count + 1
                
                IF screenshot['attach'] == TRUE THEN
                    i. mail.Attachments.Add(screenshot['path'])
            
            h. IF signature exists THEN
                APPEND signature TO html_body
            
            i. IF disclaimer exists THEN
                APPEND disclaimer TO html_body
            
            j. CLOSE HTML document
        
        8. SET MAIL BODY:
            mail.HTMLBody ← html_body
        
        9. SAVE DRAFT:
            mail.Save()
        
        10. LOG "Email draft created successfully"
        
        11. CLEANUP:
            a. pythoncom.CoUninitialize()
        
        12. RETURN TRUE
    END
```

**Email HTML Structure:**

```html
<html>
  <body style="font-family: Century; font-size: 10pt;">
    <p>[Email Body Text with timestamp]</p>
    
    <!-- Embedded Screenshots -->
    <img src="cid:image_0" style="max-width: 80%;">
    <img src="cid:image_1" style="max-width: 80%;">
    
    <!-- Signature -->
    <p>[Signature]</p>
    
    <!-- Disclaimer -->
    <p style="font-size: 10px; color: #666;">
      [Disclaimer Text]
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
```

