## Error Recovery Strategies

### 1. COM Object Initialization
```
Strategy: Multi-tier fallback
├─ Attempt 1: DispatchEx (best for new instances)
├─ Attempt 2: Dispatch (standard)
└─ Attempt 3: dynamic.Dispatch (always works)
```

### 2. File Access Errors
```
Strategy: Validate and retry
├─ Check file exists
├─ Check file not locked
├─ Try open with ReadOnly=True
└─ Log detailed error for manual intervention
```

### 3. Screenshot Capture Failures
```
Strategy: Continue processing others
├─ Log failed screenshot
├─ Continue with remaining screenshots
├─ Proceed to email draft if any screenshots succeeded
└─ Abort only if no screenshots captured
```

### 4. Email Drafting Errors
```
Strategy: Preserve data
├─ Keep screenshots on disk
├─ Keep Excel file intact
├─ Log error details
└─ Allow manual email creation
```

