## Appendices

### Appendix A: File Pattern Reference

#### Basic Patterns

| Pattern | Description | Examples Matched |
|---------|-------------|------------------|
| `*.xlsm` | All XLSM files | Any .xlsm file |
| `Report_*.xlsx` | Files starting with "Report_" | Report_Q1.xlsx, Report_Final.xlsx |
| `*_Summary.xlsm` | Files ending with "_Summary" | Q1_Summary.xlsm, Annual_Summary.xlsm |
| `MI_*.xlsm` | Files starting with "MI_" | MI_Forecast.xlsm, MI_Actual.xlsm |

#### Advanced Patterns

| Pattern | Description | Examples Matched |
|---------|-------------|------------------|
| `Q[1-4]_*.xlsm` | Q1, Q2, Q3, or Q4 prefix | Q1_Report.xlsm, Q3_Final.xlsm |
| `Report_202411??.xlsm` | November 2024 dates | Report_20241101.xlsm, Report_20241130.xlsm |
| `[ABC]_Report.xlsm` | A, B, or C prefix | A_Report.xlsm, C_Report.xlsm |
| `Report_[!X]*.xlsm` | Not starting with X after "Report_" | Report_ABC.xlsm (excludes Report_XYZ.xlsm) |

#### Character Classes

| Pattern Element | Matches | Example |
|----------------|---------|---------|
| `*` | Zero or more characters | `*.xlsm` matches all .xlsm files |
| `?` | Exactly one character | `File?.xlsm` matches File1.xlsm, FileA.xlsm |
| `[abc]` | One of: a, b, or c | `File[123].xlsm` matches File1.xlsm, File2.xlsm |
| `[a-z]` | Any lowercase letter | `Report[a-z].xlsm` matches Reporta.xlsm |
| `[!abc]` | Not a, b, or c | `File[!X].xlsm` matches FileA.xlsm (not FileX.xlsm) |

